  "body": "Set quietly off the road with an elevated outlook, this brand new quality-built home offers an exceptional opportunity for large families or multi-generational living. Thoughtfully designed over two spacious levels, there’s room for everyone to relax, entertain, and enjoy their own space.\r\n\r\nThe upper level features three double bedrooms and two bathrooms including a private master suite with walk-in wardrobe, ensuite, and sliders opening to the expansive rear deck. Everyday living is effortless with a generous open-plan kitchen, dining and lounge zone complemented by a separate lounge/media room. The stylish entertainers kitchen is a real highlight with quality Miele appliances, mains gas for the cooktop and hot water, an Insinkerator plus a scullery including its own sink and hob. Seamless flow to the large sun-soaked deck makes everyday living and summer BBQ's a joy.\r\n\r\nThe ground level is ideal for extended family, teenagers or guests - a second living room plus two additional bedrooms and bathroom create a self-contained feel. Also on this level, you'll find a large carpeted double garage with separate well-appointed laundry room. Further off-street parking for up to four vehicles completes the home’s practical offering.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include:\r\n\r\n- Ducted air-conditioning for year-round comfort\r\n- Video intercom entry\r\n- Low-maintenance weatherboard construction\r\n- Easy-care freehold section\r\n\r\nA superb executive home that delivers flexibility, privacy and style. Situated handy to Millwater shops, Silverdale Mall, Kingsway and Stella Maris schools, motorway access, and just a short drive to Orewa Beach - offering convenience and lifestyle in one.\r\n\r\nTo view this property, contact owner(s): Jamie Qin - Phone: 021 0293 0736. No agents please.",
